  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Bring a medium saucepan of salted water to boil.\n• Cook spaghetti in boiling water until ‘al dente’, 10 mins.\n• Reserve some pasta water (1/2 cup for 2P / 1 cup for 4P) then drain and return to pan. Drizzle with a little olive oil to prevent sticking.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6674b6e79deef291574f5032-b4c16e01.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, grate carrot. Thinly slice celery. Finely chop garlic. Roughly chop tomato and brown onion.\n• Drain and rinse lentils.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6674b6e79deef291574f5032-eef25de0.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan, with a drizzle of olive oil over high heat. Cook carrot, celery, tomato and onion until softened, 4-5 mins.\n• Reduce heat to medium and stir in garlic, garlic seasoning, herby tomato seasoning and tomato paste and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Add lentils, diced tomatoes with onion & garlic (see ingredients), reserved pasta water, the butter and brown sugar and simmer until thickened, 2-3 mins.\n• Add cooked spaghetti and toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6674b6e79deef291574f5032-10b13d98.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide spaghetti and lentil bolognese between bowls.\n• Top with Cheddar cheese.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6674b6e79deef291574f5032-606ff825.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
